  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The fcrepo-audit-triplestore module does not deploy correctly in karaf. This is due to upstream changes in the use of RDF parsing libraries, particularly since the resolution of ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1667"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1667",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "That ticket involved replacing fcrepo-camel's RDF processing facility with jena (moving away from clerezza). Doing so, however, left the fcrepo-audit-triplestore with missing transitive dependencies. This is a ticket to refactor the RDF processing to use Jena, too.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Karaf 4.0.1",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
