     "body": "<p>When testing this PR, I hit an issue with fcrepo-indexing-triplestore which may be related. See attached karaf.log</p>\n\n<p>Note: I am a little bit surprised that integration tests do not flag issues like this.</p>\n\n<p>Note2: I see that fcrepo-camel-toolbox is pegged to the last release of fcrepo-camel:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/pom.xml#L178\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/pom.xml#L178</a></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>When I bump it to 4.3.1-SNAPSHOT, I get compilation errors.</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "14/Sep/15 7:22 PM",
