  "description": "<p>The fcrepo-audit-triplestore module does not deploy correctly in karaf. This is due to upstream changes in the use of RDF parsing libraries, particularly since the resolution of <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1667\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1667</a>.</p>\n\n<p>That ticket involved replacing fcrepo-camel's RDF processing facility with jena (moving away from clerezza). Doing so, however, left the fcrepo-audit-triplestore with missing transitive dependencies. This is a ticket to refactor the RDF processing to use Jena, too.</p>\n",
